					<![CDATA[
						 <p>You know it's a good Broken God tale when you can here the cogs churning in the background as you're reading. I love all the one and zero imagery, and how all interpretations are viewed by Wan, in the end, with indifference. He knows he'll come eventually. He just needs time to build. +1</p> 
				 	]]>
