					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Gift for the art exchange for ihp. Thanks to him and to The Great Hippo for feedback before I posted.</p> <p>Had a weird thought about how if the technological singularity happened and created a capital G god it would had to've always existed but also only come into being after a series of events. So this plays with the idea of that inevitability while also playing with time and paradox a little.</p> 
